521
00:44:31.569 --> 00:44:33.103
Temple?

522
00:44:44.949 --> 00:44:47.918
Where do they go?

523
00:44:48.018 --> 00:44:49.219
I don't know.

524
00:44:49.319 --> 00:44:51.188
Um, heaven,

525
00:44:51.288 --> 00:44:53.758
Maybe.
Uh, somewhere.

526
00:44:56.727 --> 00:45:01.331
