699
00:55:40.770 --> 00:55:42.706
Do you want to watch
"the man from u.N.C.L.E."?

700
00:55:45.442 --> 00:55:48.478
Oh! You can't watch
"the man from u.N.C.L.E."

701
00:55:48.578 --> 00:55:50.847
I do.
I'd love to watch it.

702
00:55:50.947 --> 00:55:52.982
Will you show me
